{"unit_id":"baixianger__dsh-chat#feature-1","repo":"baixianger/dsh-chat","commit":"99a224c76b4e668ddc7874fbd39b063718260697","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Chat 的功能「创建和加入房间」：通过工具按名称创建群聊并让当前会话加入，也能按房间名或 ID 加入已有本地房间。房间会成为 Chatrooms 工作区中的持久会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:159-177","lib/index.js:169-177","lib/room-store.js:197-215"]}
